S2-cm-wf.cir -- A cmos pair (nmos loaded by pmos)

* Analysis of responses V(2) for sinusoidal excitations
* We can apply one of three amplitudes of the excitation
*    0.1V   almost small signal operation 
*    0.5V   mean distortion
*    1V     strongly nonlinear effects
* uncomment one of the following three lines
VIN  1 0 AC 1 SIN(2.5,0.1,1K,0,0)
*VIN 1 0 AC 1 SIN(2.5,0.5,1K,0,0)
*VIN 1 0 AC 1 SIN(2.5,1,1K,0,0)

M1 2 1 0 0 MODN
M2 3 1 2 3 MODP
.MODEL MODN NMOS KP 80e-6 VTO 0.75
.MODEL MODP PMOS KP 30e-6 VTO -1
VDD 3 0 5

* time-domain analysis of waveforms
.options
*.TRAN 0.01M 10M 0 0.01M

* a.c. analysis
*.AC DEC 10 100 1000MEG
.TF V(2) VIN

* we observe the output waveform V(2) and input V(1)
.PROBE V(1) V(2)
.END
